{"id":"W0a83cfaffb6be7274ffcf9ca","zh":"轮轨界面系统","en":"","name":"轮轨界面系统","language":"zh","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","concept_id":"Cab576f7e5333f50f4442","families":[],"definition_zh":"在车辆与轨道子系统之间表达接触几何和作用力关系的界面部分。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W0a83cfaffb6be7274ffcf9ca","text":"轮轨界面系统","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S5bffb4fdb27190c0c600","source_id":"P113","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"该模型将车辆-轨道耦合系统分为车辆子系统、轨道子系统及轮轨界面系统,可考虑车辆系统、线路系统参数的随机性及轨道随机不平顺的时变性,同时采用数论法实现不同动力参数的组合,用概率密度演化方程解决系统激励输入与响应输出的概率密度传递问题。","citations":[{"source_id":"P113","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S4ec0e4ac8303f2499f9b","source_id":"P113","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文基于车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论 [6],建立了车辆-轨道有限元耦合动力模型,包括车辆子系统、轨道子系统及轮轨界面系统三部分,见图2。","citations":[{"source_id":"P113","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P113":{"id":"P113","title":"车辆-轨道系统时-空随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.01.012","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-stochastic-model-used-for-temporal-spatial-analysis-of-vehicle-track-coupled-systems"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"Wfd84d077d60e05f65b7b99ba","name":"wheel-rail interfacial subsystem","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wfd84d077d60e05f65b7b99ba","name":"wheel-rail interfacial subsystem","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wfd84d077d60e05f65b7b99ba","name":"wheel-rail interfacial subsystem","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P113","title":"车辆-轨道系统时-空随机分析模型","authors